    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051120.0006\n\nBEIJING, Nov. 20 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nURGENT: China's peaceful development inevitable, Hu says\n\n\n\n\nChina's path of peaceful development is \"an inevitable choice\" based on its national conditions, its historical and cultural traditions and the current development trend in today's world, Chinese President Hu Jintao said here Sunday.\n\nHu made the remarks when meeting the press after his talks with visiting US President George W. Bush.",
